      "id": "f1",
      "weekId": "w_01",
      "branchId": "b_axial",
      "title": "Axial flux has a power-density advantage",
      "text": "Axial flux architecture can provide high torque density and compact packaging, but manufacturing complexity remains a major barrier. Nobody in India appears to produce them at volume.",
